  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a blade of pure ether, your void blade is perfectly suited to take on the aspect of any blast etherspells delivered with it.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Etherstrike class feature, void blade class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you deliver a blast etherspell with your void blade through the use of the etherstrike class feature, you may dismiss your void blade as a free action immediately after making your attack roll. If you do, on a successful hit, your void blade deals damage of the same type or types as the etherspell it delivered.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ethermagic-feats#toc25\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
